  "summary": {
   "status": "complete",
   "text": "In September 2025 testimony, LaCerte said AI, data centers, and reindustrialization compound issues requiring planning, forecasting, and regulatory oversight from states and FERC. In February 2026 testimony as Commissioner, he described the AI race as transforming how Americans engage, transact, and compete globally and called the U.S. power grid a major battlefield. He also said China has been adding electric capacity rapidly while the U.S. works to catch up on interconnection bottlenecks, and he argued FERC should lead reforms to ensure data centers and chip manufacturing get needed energy on time.",
   "sids": [
    "s1",
    "s2",
    "s3",
    "s4"
   ],
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "In September 2025 testimony, LaCerte said AI, data centers, and reindustrialization compound issues requiring planning, forecasting, and regulatory oversight from states and FERC.",
